<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND BEAT UNITED ARAB EMIRATES 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND BEAT UNITED ARAB EMIRATES 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>WODZISLAW SLASKI, Poland 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland beat the United Arab Emirates 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Dariusz Rzezniczak (35th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
